  heroes  java_properties.decode
  go      -
  rust    -
  python  -
  note    `PropertyResourceBundle` read UTF-8, and read a file holding one byte that is not UTF-8 again whole as ISO 8859-1 ("k=é" in ISO 8859-1 beside "j=é" in UTF-8 gave "é" and "Ã©"), observed on 2026-11-22; the JDK's system property `java.util.PropertyResourceBundle.encoding`, which forces one, is a choice of `decode` or `decode_latin1`

